dist/

# assets/built/ IS committed — screen.css and the minified scripts both. They
# are compiled from the Creator Design System, a local authoring-time
# dependency the deploy cannot resolve, so the artefacts ship with the theme.
# Run `npm run build` and commit the result whenever assets/css/, assets/js/ or
# the system itself changes.

# Authoring-only Claude Code material: skills, notes, docs for working on this
# theme. Ghost never reads it (build-dist.mjs's INCLUDE_DIRS doesn't list it),
# and it doesn't belong in the public GitHub history — kept locally only.
